# mustr's update-signing public key: Ed25519, in base64, on a line of its own. mustr is built
# with it (src/updates.rs) and checks each release's manifest.json.sig against it.
#
# PLACEHOLDER: there's no key line yet, so mustr's updater stays off and logs why. To set it up
# (mustr-docs/RELEASING.md, "The signing key"):
#   cargo run -p mustr_release -- keygen <private key file>
# then put the public key it prints on the line below this comment, commit, and store the
# private key as the MUSTR_UPDATE_SIGNING_KEY secret.
